### Variáveis globais / Global variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@id = 1

### 1. Criar conta / Create account
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "123.456.789-00",
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "amount": 1000.00
}

###

### 2. Criar segunda conta / Create second account
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "987.654.321-00",
  "name": "João Souza",
  "amount": 500.00
}

###

### 3. Listar contas / List accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts

###

### 4. Buscar conta por ID / Get account by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{id}}

###

### 5. Depositar / Deposit
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{id}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 250.00
}

###

### 6. Sacar / Withdraw
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{id}}/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 300.00
}

###

### 7. Erro: depósito com valor zero / Error: deposit with zero amount
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{id}}/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 0
}

###

### 8. Erro: conta inexistente / Error: account not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/9999

###
